<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile sells 147kg of germanium to Mistral.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile sells 147kg of germanium to Mistral.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center said it sold 147 kilograms of germanium to Mistral Inc for a total of $199,920, or a unit price of $1,360 per kilo.</p>
<p>The next bid opening for germanium is June 24.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
</text>
